ve) 30:13 ; ׳שׁ גָּדוֺל || (רָעָהׅ Jer 4:6 ; 6:1 , ׳עַלשֿׁ׳שׁ 4:20 ; וָשׁ ׳שֹׁד Isa 59:7 ; 60:18 ; Jer 48:3 , compare Isa 51:19 ; וְהַשּׁ ׳הַשֵּׁאת Lam 3:47 ; שׁ ׳זַעֲקַת Isa 15:5 , compare Jer 48:5 ; of individual Prov 16:18 ; 17:19 ; 18:12 ; figurative, ׳שׁ רוּחַ crushing of spirit, compare 15:4 ; so ( רוּחַ omitted) מִשְּׁבָרִים Job 41:17 from terror , Di De, compare Bi, but dubious; Buhl Bu conjectures יָם מִשְׁבְּרֵי , Gie גִּבֹּרִים מִשִּׁנָּיו , Du מִשְׁמָרִים . 2 crashing , Zeph 1:10 (|| יְלָלָה צְעָקָה, קוֺל ), Jer 50:22 (|| מִלְחָמָה ), 51:54 (|| זְעָקָה קוֺל ). 3 breaking of a dream, i.e. its interpretation ( solution of mystery) Judg 7:15 (compare GFM). 4 הַשְּׁבָרִים Josh 7:5 , perhaps (Di Benn Steuern) the quarries as proper name, of a location, ᵑ9 Sabarim (&gt; הִשָּֽׁבְרָם ᵑ7 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 ). — שִׁבְרִי Ezek 32:9 , read ᵐ5 שִׁבְיְךָ Co Sta Berthol Krae (not Toy).","rootNote":"or שֵׁבֶר ; from 7665 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Amos 6 6","keyReferences":["Amos 6 6","Ezek 32 9","Isa 1 28","Isa 15 5","Isa 30 13","Isa 30 14","Isa 30 26","Isa 51 19"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":44,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Amos 6 6","book":"Amos","chapter":6,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֵׁ֥בֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 32 9","book":"Ezek","chapter":32,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁבְרְ/ךָ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Isa 1 28","book":"Isa","chapter":1,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֶׁ֧בֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 15 5","book":"Isa","chapter":15,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֶׁ֖בֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 30 13","book":"Isa","chapter":30,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁבְרָֽ/הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Isa 30 14","book":"Isa","chapter":30,"verse":1